---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Advertise With Texoma Weekend Guide"
  description="Reach people looking for events, entertainment, and local businesses across Texoma with optional paid promotion from Texoma Weekend Guide."
>
  <section class="advertise-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow light">Reach an active local audience</p>
        <h1>Advertise With TWG</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          Put your business, venue, service, or event in front of people actively
          looking for things to do and places to go across Texoma.
        </p>
        <p class="promise">
          Basic business and community event listings remain free. Paid advertising
          is optional and provides additional visibility, featured placement, and active promotion.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="#contact">Ask About Advertising</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/support/">Support the Guide</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="stats-card" aria-label="Current Texoma Weekend Guide platform statistics">
        <p class="stats-label">Current platform reach</p>
        <div class="stats-grid">
          <div><strong>2,000+</strong><span>Page visits in the past 30 days</span></div>
          <div><strong>259</strong><span>Published businesses</span></div>
          <div><strong>42</strong><span>Active events</span></div>
          <div><strong>12</strong><span>Cities represented</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="stats-note">Statistics are updated as the guide continues to grow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading centered">
        <p class="eyebrow">More than a listing</p>
        <h2>Promotion built around your business</h2>
        <p>
          Provide the details, photos, logos, dates, and updates, and Texoma Weekend Guide
          will turn them into useful, visible local promotion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="benefit-grid">
        <article class="benefit-card">
          <span aria-hidden="true">🏪</span>
          <h3>Enhanced directory presence</h3>
          <p>Add your logo, additional photos, stronger business details, links, amenities, and other useful information to help visitors understand what you offer.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="benefit-card">
          <span aria-hidden="true">⭐</span>
          <h3>Featured placement</h3>
          <p>Eligible advertisers may receive prominent placement on the homepage and other high-visibility areas of the site.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="benefit-card">
          <span aria-hidden="true">📅</span>
          <h3>Event promotion</h3>
          <p>Upcoming events can receive individual event pages, directory placement, reminders, and additional promotion when complete details are provided.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="benefit-card">
          <span aria-hidden="true">📱</span>
          <h3>Social media promotion</h3>
          <p>Advertising may include Facebook posts, Story reminders, reshares, and timely follow-up promotion based on the campaign.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="benefit-card">
          <span aria-hidden="true">🎨</span>
          <h3>Custom promotional graphics</h3>
          <p>Featured partners and events may receive branded graphics designed for clear, consistent presentation across the site and social media.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="benefit-card">
          <span aria-hidden="true">🔎</span>
          <h3>Local discovery</h3>
          <p>Your listing remains connected to searchable business, event, city, category, and venue information as the platform expands.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section compare-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading centered">
        <p class="eyebrow">Clear and straightforward</p>
        <h2>Free listings and paid promotion serve different purposes</h2>
        <p>Every local business can be included. Advertising is for businesses that want more active and sustained exposure.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="comparison-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Basic listing</th><th>Paid advertiser</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Business directory listing</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Community event listing</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Logo and expanded photo presentation</td><td>Limited</td><td>Enhanced</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Featured homepage placement</td><td>Not included</td><td>Available</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Dedicated social promotion</td><td>Occasional editorial coverage</td><td>Campaign priority</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Story reminders and reshares</td><td>Not guaranteed</td><td>Available</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Custom promotional graphics</td><td>Not guaranteed</td><td>Available</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Priority updates</td><td>Standard queue</td><td>Priority handling</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="clarification">
        Free inclusion is never conditioned on purchasing advertising. Paid promotion affects visibility and promotional effort—not whether a legitimate local business or community event can be listed.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section example-section">
    <div class="container example-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow light">A working example</p>
        <h2>Featured-partner promotion is already active</h2>
        <p>
          Texoma Weekend Guide has already used featured homepage placement, event pages,
          custom graphics, pinned social content, and Story reminders to support a paying promotional client.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your campaign can be built around the information and materials you provide,
          with a focus on keeping your business and events visible instead of posting once and disappearing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="example-card">
        <strong>Possible campaign elements</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Featured business or performer placement</li>
          <li>Individual event pages</li>
          <li>Custom event and partner graphics</li>
          <li>Feed posts and timely reminders</li>
          <li>Facebook Story promotion</li>
          <li>Directory logos and photo galleries</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="contact">
    <div class="container contact-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
        <h2>Tell us what you want to promote</h2>
        <p>
          Share your business name, goals, upcoming dates, and the kind of visibility you need.
          Advertising options can be shaped around the campaign rather than forcing every business into the same box.
        </p>
        <p class="contact-note">
          The more complete your information, photos, logos, event dates, and links are, the more effectively Texoma Weekend Guide can promote you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form class="contact-form" action="https://formsubmit.co/texomaweekendguide@gmail.com" method="POST">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="TWG Advertising Inquiry" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://texomaweekendguide.com/advertise/?sent=true" />

        <label>Business or organization name<input name="business_name" type="text" required /></label>
        <label>Your name<input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
        <label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
        <label>Phone number <span>(optional)</span><input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" /></label>
        <label>What would you like to promote?<textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></label>
        <button class="button submit-button" type="submit">Send Advertising Inquiry</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
  if (new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get("sent") === "true") {
    const message = document.createElement("div");
    message.className = "sent-message";
    message.textContent = "Thank you — your advertising inquiry was sent successfully.";
    document.querySelector(".contact-form")?.prepend(message);
  }
</script>

<style>
  .advertise-hero { padding: 5rem 0; background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--navy), #176f95); color: white; }
  .hero-grid, .example-grid, .contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
  .advertise-hero h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: white; font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero-copy { color: white; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.65rem); font-weight: 800; }
  .promise { padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 5px solid var(--gold); color: white; font-weight: 700; }
  .light { color: #bfeaf0; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .hero-actions .secondary { border-color: white; background: transparent; color: white; }
  .stats-card { padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); border-radius: 28px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
  .stats-label { margin-top: 0; color: #d7f4f7; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .stats-grid div { padding: 1rem; border-radius: 16px; background: white; color: var(--navy); }
  .stats-grid strong { display: block; font-size: 2rem; }
  .stats-grid span { display: block; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .stats-note { margin-bottom: 0; color: white; font-size: .9rem; }
  .centered { margin-inline: auto; text-align: center; }
  .benefit-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.25rem; }
  .benefit-card, .example-card { padding: 1.6rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; background: white; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .benefit-card span { font-size: 2rem; }
  .benefit-card h3 { color: var(--navy); }
  .compare-section { background: #e9f3f2; }
  .comparison-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  table { width: 100%; min-width: 680px; border-collapse: collapse; background: white; }
  th, td { padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); text-align: left; }
  th { background: var(--navy); color: white; }
  th:not(:first-child), td:not(:first-child) { text-align: center; }
  .clarification, .contact-note { margin-top: 1.25rem; padding: 1rem; border-left: 5px solid var(--gold); background: white; font-weight: 700; }
  .example-section { background: var(--navy); color: white; }
  .example-section h2, .example-section p { color: white; }
  .example-card { color: var(--ink); }
  .example-card ul { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .contact-grid { align-items: start; }
  .contact-form { display: grid; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.6rem; border-radius: 22px; background: white; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .contact-form label { display: grid; gap: .35rem; color: var(--navy); font-weight: 800; }
  .contact-form label span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .contact-form input, .contact-form textarea { width: 100%; padding: .8rem; border: 1px solid #aebdc5; border-radius: 10px; background: white; color: var(--ink); font: inherit; }
  .contact-form textarea { resize: vertical; }
  .submit-button { border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .sent-message { padding: .9rem; border-radius: 10px; background: #dff6e4; color: #145b27; font-weight: 800; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .hero-grid, .example-grid, .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .benefit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .advertise-hero { padding: 3.5rem 0; } .benefit-grid, .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
